e villages in Sagbara/Dediapada.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Part Lead Time:</strong> Specific inverter PCB components may take 2-3 days to source from rajpipla.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Visit Fee:</strong> An inspection charge applies if no repair is carried out.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"repair-types\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>Cooling Services for Rajpipla &#038; Kevadia</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid-3\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 16.5c0 .38-.21.71-.53.88l-7.97 4.19c-.32.17-.66.17-.98 0l-7.97-4.19c-.32-.17-.55-.5-.55-.88V7.5c0-.38.21-.71.53-.88l7.97-4.19c.32-.17.66-.17.98 0l7.97 4.19c.32.17.55.5.55.88v9z\"/></svg>\n                <h3>Residential AC Repair</h3>\n                <p>Fast service for Palace Road and Station Road. We fix leakage, noise, and PCB issues in Split &#038; Window ACs.</p>\n                <a href=\"/split-ac-service-rajpipla\" style=\"color: var(--blue); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">Home Services</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2L4.5 20.29l.71.71L12 18l6.79 3 .71-.71z\"/></svg>\n                <h3>Hotel &#038; Resort Cooling</h3>\n                <p>Maintenance of <strong>Cassette Units</strong> and <strong>VRF Systems</strong> for luxury tents and hotels in Kevadia and Garudeshwar.</p>\n                <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-rajpipla\" style=\"color: var(--blue); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">Hotel Support</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z\"/></svg>\n                <h3>Comme