tion\">9. Do you work on Sundays in Kevadia?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we offer emergency services on Sundays, especially for the hospitality sector in Kevadia to ensure tourist comfort.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">10. How do I book a technician?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Click the WhatsApp button or call +91 97272 57141 to schedule a visit from our Narmada-based expert team.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"footer-links\">\n            <a href=\"/home\">Home</a> | <a href=\"/shop\">Shop</a> | <a href=\"/ac-service-rajpipla\">rajpipla</a> | <a href=\"/ac-service-center-ankleshwar\">Ankleshwar</a> | <a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Rajpipla Support</a>\n        </div>\n        <p>&copy; 2026 Atlas Aircon &#8211; Independent <span class=\"focus-keyword\">voltas ac service center Rajpipla</span>. The Trusted Choice for Narmada District Cooling.</p>\n        <p>Location: Serving Rajpipla, Kevadia, Garudeshwar &#038; Narmada District | Phone: +91 97272 57141 | Email: atlasaircon1@gmail.com</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // Simple FAQ toggle\n        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(item => {\n            item.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                const answer = item.nextElementSibling;\n                if (answer.style.display === 'block') {\n                    answer.style.display = 'none';\n                } else {\n                    answer.style.display = 'block';\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</div>",
